{"id":"434f0e097f1ba765","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-thm-godel-constructible.md","title":"Constructibility","display":"thm-godel-constructible — Constructibility","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-godel-constructible","aliases":["58-thm-godel-constructible"],"display":"thm-godel-constructible — Constructibility","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-constructible.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]","[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-inner-model.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-godel-constructible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-godel-constructible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-godel-constructible — Constructibility"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3743f726a3653802\" href=\"?note=3743f726a3653802\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-constructible.md\">../batch16/58-df-constructible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md\">../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5a435dbfefa9e0ed\" href=\"?note=5a435dbfefa9e0ed\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-inner-model.md\">../batch17/58-df-inner-model.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle L_\\alpha:\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\rangle\">\\(\\langle L_\\alpha:\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\rangle\\)</span> (constructible universe and hierarchy)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S,\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S,\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span> (inner-model and limit-ordinal predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GCH}\">\\(\\mathrm{GCH}\\)</span> (the additional theory interpreted in the inner model) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> (metatheoretic satisfaction for the proper-class structure)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}godel\\text{-}constructible} \\vdash L=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}}L_\\alpha\\land L_0=\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(L_{\\alpha+1}=\\operatorname{Def}(L_\\alpha))\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to L_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}L_\\alpha\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}godel\\text{-}constructible} \\vdash L=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}}L_\\alpha\\land L_0=\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(L_{\\alpha+1}=\\operatorname{Def}(L_\\alpha))\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to L_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}L_\\alpha\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}godel\\text{-}constructible} \\vdash \\mathrm{InnerModel}_S(L)\\land(L,\\in)\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{GCH}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}godel\\text{-}constructible} \\vdash \\mathrm{InnerModel}_S(L)\\land(L,\\in)\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{GCH}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> is the minimal inner model containing every ordinal; it is generally a proper class, not a set-sized “smallest transitive model.”</li>\n<li>Gödel proved internally that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\mathrm{GCH}\">\\(L\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\mathrm{GCH}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The unary inner-model predicate already entails transitivity, containment of all ordinals, and satisfaction of ZFC; GCH is therefore stated as the additional satisfaction clause instead of being passed as a nonexistent second argument.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-constructible.md","status":"resolved","id":"3743f726a3653802","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-constructible.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","loca